}].\n$$\n\nNext, we find the eigenvalues of $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|A-\\lambda I| & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-2\\lambda -8 & =0 \\\\ \\lambda  & =4,\\,-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our quadratic form can be reduced to $4{y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{2}^{2}.$ \n\nIn the new variables, the curve has the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{y}_{1}^{2}-2{y}_{2}^{2} & =8 \\\\ \\frac{{y}_{1}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}_{2}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{y}_{1}^{2}}{(\\sqrt{2})^{2}}-\\frac{{y}_{2}^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a hyperbola with semiaxes $\\sqrt{2}$ and $2.$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383546 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383547 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383548 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383549 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383550 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1041 "selection" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383550 13194139536100 true] [17592186383545 1110 #uuid "6ea237b0-048f-539e-b0c4-52571eb82fe0" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383546 1034 "An ellipse with semiaxes $-1$ and $\\sqrt{3}$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383546 1111 #uuid "8e38b7ce-bd28-5611-984c-3d2523813823" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383547 1034 "A pair of intersecting lines" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383547 1111 #uuid "c4c774e2-7fae-53ab-b632-2dbef3a59556" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383548 1034 "A circle with radius $2$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383548 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383548 1111 #uuid "7375a74b-35c8-5078-82e7-cc4d5e1be5db" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383549 1034 "A parabol