}_{1}{x}_{2}-3{x}_{2}^{2}.$ The matrix of the form is\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that $A$ is symmetric. The principal axes of the curve \n\n$$\n{x}^{T}\\,Ax=1\n$$\n\nare the vectors that form an orthonormal eigenvector basis of $A.$ \n\nBy solving the characteristic equation $|A-\\lambda I|=0,$ we obtain\n\n$\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{1}=13\\,$ and $\\,{\\lambda }_{2}=-12.$\n\nLet's now find the eigenvectors.\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=13,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-13I & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -3\\end{aligned}]-13[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-9 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -16\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-13I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{1}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{1}‖=5,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=-12,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-12)I & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -3\\end{aligned}]+12[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}16 & 12 \\\\ 12 & 9\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-12)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{2}‖=5,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the principal axes of our curve are\n\n$\\,$ $\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383588 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383589 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383590 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383591 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383592 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1041 "selection" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383590 13194139536100 true] [17592186383587 1110 #uuid "fca7bd62-6c64-59d7-9614-84d916bd4c29" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383588 1034 "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383588 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383588 1111 #uuid "b2a0f586-3fe4-5db2-9bbb-e73db2312994" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383589 1034 "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383589 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383589 1111 #uuid "90ffe2e5-1380-5278-81e7-3bba0f69f756" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383590 1034 "$\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383590 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383590 1111 #uuid "55cb96b8-f8e5-5ef9-9958-3aa7b48f3044" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383591 1034 "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383591 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383591 1111 #uuid "3c69cba2-74d1-5d12-863a-6e1f734ec6d1" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383592 1034 "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383592 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536100 true] [17592186383592 1111 #uuid "6bc5490b-0a80-59bd-b8d1-d2ea97c4ca38" 13194139536100 true] [17592186383593 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383594 